      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Exercise stress test is the most widely used instrument in the detection of myocardial ischemia. We try to develop a score for objective and subjective symptoms occurring during this investigation. 428 stress tests are registrated, the parameters are documented, investigated according to a logical schema and data processed."},
